Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 16:19:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] comdlg32: Add a thumbnails view button and remember the
 view mode.

The explorer style dialog gets a Thumbnails toolbar button next to List
and Details. The view mode picked in either file dialog is stored in
HKCU\Software\Wine\FileDialog "ViewMode" and used by both dialogs the
next time they open.
